{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":2,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":60,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1904244,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":284700,"Name":"Michelle84","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1441549979,"LastPoster":{"Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1904244,"PostDate":1441549979,"PostContent":"We have booked the Riu Palace Bavaro for our wedding in July 2016. (The Royal wedding package) Ou...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"michelle_sutherland13@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"90.213.3.9","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1441549342,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Michelle84","Id":284700,"Name":"Michelle84","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"90.213.3.9","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79570,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Michelle84, Yesterday, 02:35 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1441550156,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cc82d7a029c427059d2c6c350ad64933","RawContent":"We have booked the Riu Palace Bavaro for our wedding in July 2016. (The Royal wedding package) Our date has just been confirmed but I have had no luck when contacting the hotel for more info. \n\n\nHas anyone been married here and wouldn&#039;t mind sharing some info or pics. \n\n\nI was wondering if anyone has used the spa for hair\/makeup or the hotels own photographer. Do you have to have the wedding on the beach or is there anywhere else? We are traveling in a small group 6-8 guests, how does this go in terms of after the wedding. As  wouldn&#039;t be much point hiring dj ect for such a small party.\n\n\nThanks, any advise appreciated.\n\n\nMichelle.","Attachments":[],"Id":1904244,"PostDate":1441549979,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We have booked the Riu Palace Bavaro for our wedding in July 2016. (The Royal wedding package) Our date has just been confirmed but I have had no luck when contacting the hotel for more info. <br><br>\nHas anyone been married here and wouldn't mind sharing some info or pics. <br><br>\nI was wondering if anyone has used the spa for hair\/makeup or the hotels own photographer. Do you have to have the wedding on the beach or is there anywhere else? We are traveling in a small group 6-8 guests, how does this go in terms of after the wedding. As  wouldn't be much point hiring dj ect for such a small party.<br><br>\nThanks, any advise appreciated.<br><br>\nMichelle.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"michelle_sutherland13@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"90.213.3.9","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1441549342,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Michelle84","Id":284700,"Name":"Michelle84","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"177.237.80.72","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79570,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"96b489ba404b247ec1f0ad2e03f16c7f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community Michelle and Congrats on your upcoming RUI Palace Bavaro wedding!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You may already have seen this, but in case you didn&#039;t, here is a link to some iinfo on your venue: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?s=e40e684699756bb1b553588367222484&amp;amp;app=googlecse#gsc.tab=0&amp;amp;gsc.q=RUI%20Palace%20Bavaro&#039;&gt;RUI Palace threads&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope you find all the answers you&#039;re looking for, and all the very best with your process - cheers!!! team mtm :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;.....here are some magical wedding moments that matter we captured in our area of Mexico at the &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153270894224487.1073741928.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;RUI Palace Peninsula Cancun&lt;\/a&gt;, for further inspiration...enjoy :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtf1\/t31.0-8\/10631153_10153270894489487_983570626293487655_o.jpg\" alt=\"10631153_10153270894489487_9835706262934\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xft1\/t31.0-8\/11154896_10153270896924487_3474345644144793740_o.jpg\" alt=\"11154896_10153270896924487_3474345644144\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/11164868_10153270897984487_5080327784522285468_o.jpg\" alt=\"11164868_10153270897984487_5080327784522\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904275,"PostDate":1441624534,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community Michelle and Congrats on your upcoming RUI Palace Bavaro wedding!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You may already have seen this, but in case you didn't, here is a link to some iinfo on your venue: <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?s=e40e684699756bb1b553588367222484&app=googlecse#gsc.tab=0&gsc.q=RUI%20Palace%20Bavaro' class='bbc_url' title=''>RUI Palace threads<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope you find all the answers you're looking for, and all the very best with your process - cheers!!! team mtm <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>.....here are some magical wedding moments that matter we captured in our area of Mexico at the <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153270894224487.1073741928.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>RUI Palace Peninsula Cancun<\/a>, for further inspiration...enjoy <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtf1\/t31.0-8\/10631153_10153270894489487_983570626293487655_o.jpg\" alt=\"10631153_10153270894489487_9835706262934\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xft1\/t31.0-8\/11154896_10153270896924487_3474345644144793740_o.jpg\" alt=\"11154896_10153270896924487_3474345644144\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/11164868_10153270897984487_5080327784522285468_o.jpg\" alt=\"11164868_10153270897984487_5080327784522\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280196260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79570","Title":"Riu Palace Bavaro","LastPostDate":1441624534},"Pages":{"TotalItems":2,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
