! Would you mind sharing pictures as well? My email is Anita.mannancheril@[member=\"gmail\"].com thanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":1900999,"PostDate":1437608489,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281096\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281096-jrobbins3\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jrobbins3<\/span><\/a> that's awesome that you had a fabulous time! Would you mind sharing pictures as well? My email is Anita.mannancheril@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com thanks! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"anita.mannancheril@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.70.104.175","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423781081,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Anitam","Id":282101,"Name":"Anitam","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.207.208.114","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76750,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cee5a04a982f94eb5354fadb2801d433","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey ladies,&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Ill be doing a site visit September 19-23 so I will get as much details as possible for us all. Im planning a May or June wedding 2016.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902066,"PostDate":1438936577,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey ladies,\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Ill be doing a site visit September 19-23 so I will get as much details as possible for us all. Im planning a May or June wedding 2016.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"manouchecajulce@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.207.208.114","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1436533493,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"mjulce","Id":283904,"Name":"mjulce","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"80.41.138.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76750,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cd9ff296d5376df52699694921d91f69","RawContent":"Thanks @[member=\"mjulce\"] that would be great!  We are booked for October! Can&#039;t wait \u263a\n\n\nMaybeoneday\n\n14 \/10\/2015 - R R C, Mexico","Attachments":[],"Id":1902143,"PostDate":1438995020,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283904\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283904-mjulce\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">mjulce<\/span><\/a> that would be great!  We are booked for October! Can't wait \u263a<br><br>\nMaybeoneday<br>\n14 \/10\/2015 - R R C, Mexico\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shelina_nessa@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"149.254.56.238","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1421807139,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"maybeoneday","Id":281816,"Name":"maybeoneday","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.226.11.84","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76750,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9cd338436c1548568cc79b1f228e83c8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"jrobbins3\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;First off, Congratulations! Glad you had such a wonderful experience. My name is Ashley and I&#039;d love if you could e-mail me some photos, my email address is radywedding2016@[member=\"gmail\"].com&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Second, I have been reading lots of reviews about this resort, and the main issue is a large amount of seaweed on the beach everyday. My fiance and I are huge on being in the water and hanging out at the beach daily. Did you notice that this was an issue? Thanks so much, looking forward to hearing from you!&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"mjulce\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;any feedback on the beach would be amazing!! thank you so much!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903093,"PostDate":1440197771,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281096\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281096-jrobbins3\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jrobbins3<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>First off, Congratulations! Glad you had such a wonderful experience. My name is Ashley and I'd love if you could e-mail me some photos, my email address is radywedding2016@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com<\/p>\n<p>Thank you!<\/p>\n<p>Second, I have been reading lots of reviews about this resort, and the main issue is a large amount of seaweed on the beach everyday. My fiance and I are huge on being in the water and hanging out at the beach daily. Did you notice that this was an issue? Thanks so much, looking forward to hearing from you!<\/p>\n<br \/><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283904\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283904-mjulce\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">mjulce<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>any feedback on the beach would be amazing!! thank you so much!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"radywedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.226.11.84","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440197016,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"adored1404","Id":284528,"Name":"adored1404","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.70.104.175","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76750,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b11c9faa9d1f8b4c073fbbabbf3ffde9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks @mjuice! my email address is anita.mannancheril@[member=\"gmail\"].com if you could send anything that would be awesome. My TA is going for a site visit 9\/2 -9\/4 and I will do the same for whoever would like it&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903301,"PostDate":1440479673,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks @mjuice! my email address is anita.mannancheril@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com if you could send anything that would be awesome. My TA is going for a site visit 9\/2 -9\/4 and I will do the same for whoever would like it<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"anita.mannancheril@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.70.104.175","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423781081,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Anitam","Id":282101,"Name":"Anitam","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.42.106","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76750,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d2f42354941891f6d5f811c231d58f39","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;All of the resorts from Cancun all the way to Tulum are having an issue this year with seaweed, and my husband works with a guy that has just reported that the Dominican Republic is also having an issue. Nobody seems to know definitively what&#039;s causing it except that it seems to be a combination of factors. The resorts are doing the best they can to keep ahead of it but some spots are having a tougher time than others.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903393,"PostDate":1440541819,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>All of the resorts from Cancun all the way to Tulum are having an issue this year with seaweed, and my husband works with a guy that has just reported that the Dominican Republic is also having an issue. Nobody seems to know definitively what's causing it except that it seems to be a combination of factors. The resorts are doing the best they can to keep ahead of it but some spots are having a tougher time than others.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.26.73.148","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":76750,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cd50a17f62c03f71c37433e3452ca54e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ve just noticed this resort as possible location.&amp;nbsp; Can anyone please email me details of their wedding, photos and fees?...I haven&#039;t found too much information on this resort.&amp;nbsp; The info on their website doesn&#039;t describe all the fees that were mention in this forum.&amp;nbsp; My email is canadorecc@[member=\"gmail\"].com&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904256,"PostDate":1441580003,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I've just noticed this resort as possible location.\u00a0 Can anyone please email me details of their wedding, photos and fees?...I haven't found too much information on this resort.\u00a0 The info on their website doesn't describe all the fees that were mention in this forum.\u00a0 My email is canadorecc@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"canadorecc@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.26.73.148","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440842084,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Canadorecc","Id":284608,"Name":"Canadorecc","IsOnline":true}}],"Id":"76750","Title":"New Resort - Royalton Riviera Cancun","LastPostDate":1441580003},"Pages":{"TotalItems":97,"TotalPages":10,"CurrentPage":90,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":80,"LastPage":90},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
